{"code":"st","quarters":[{"id":"2026-01","title":"Ho Hokahanya Leholimo Le Lefatše: Kreste Ho Bafilipi Le Bakolose","description":"Ak’u nahane ka mosebetsi o thata-thata oo u kileng oa u etsa. Ke’ng e entseng o be thata? E n’e le litebello, kapa nako e baletsoeng mosebetsi, kapa bobeli ba tsona? Na e bile moea oa hao ka mosebetsi oo? Kapa e bile bato bao u sebelitseng le bona? Kapa mohlomong ho ne ho mpa ho bonahala e le ntho’e ke keng ea khonahala ho hang?","human_date":"January · February · March 2026","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"27/03/2026","color_primary":"#2E4161","color_primary_dark":"#1E2C44","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Rea Hlorisoa empa ha Re Lahluoe","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"02/01/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Mabaka a Ho Leboha le Ho Rapela","start_date":"03/01/2026","end_date":"09/01/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Bophelo Le Lefu","start_date":"10/01/2026","end_date":"16/01/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Bonngoe ka Ho Ikokobetsa","start_date":"17/01/2026","end_date":"23/01/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Ho ba Maseli a Phatsimang Hara Bosiu","start_date":"24/01/2026","end_date":"30/01/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Ho Ba le Sebete ka Kreste Feela","start_date":"31/01/2026","end_date":"06/02/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Bojaki Ba Leholimonng","start_date":"07/02/2026","end_date":"13/02/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Bophahamo Ba Kreste","start_date":"14/02/2026","end_date":"20/02/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Tsepo Le Poelano","start_date":"21/02/2026","end_date":"27/02/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Ho Phetheha ho Kreste","start_date":"28/02/2026","end_date":"06/03/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Ho Phela le Kreste","start_date":"07/03/2026","end_date":"13/03/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Ho Phelisana ’Moho","start_date":"14/03/2026","end_date":"20/03/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Ho Ema Thatong Eohle ea Molimo","start_date":"21/03/2026","end_date":"27/03/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-04","title":"Neo ea Moea oa Boprofeta","description":"